\begin{definition}
\label{definition-presheaf}
Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category. A {\it presheaf of sets} (respectively, an
{\it abelian presheaf}) on $\mathcal{C}$ is a functor $\mathcal{C}^{opp} \to
\textit{Sets}$ (resp.\ $\textit{Ab}$).
\end{definition}

